          "title": "You'll want to know: परिणाम",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "परिणाम — pariṇām — \"a consequence, an outcome\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हर काम का कोई परिणाम होता है। har kām kā koī pariṇām hotā hai. Every action has some consequence."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "परिणाम (pariṇām) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit pariṇāma, \"a change; a result\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
